      "message": "In most cases we\u0027re already in a signal handler within this code (property change call), and now within that signal handler we\u0027re calling into Inventory manager. That\u0027s a bit concerning in that we could end up hung if inventory manager is stalling on something. It may be time to look into boost::asio or even the new coroutines. This service doesn\u0027t provide any dbus interfaces so it being blocked isn\u0027t horrible. Lets see if anyone else has concerns.",
