      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T16:33:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PIM requires this unusual \"Notify\" call for a persistent update but most other areas (like entity manager) do not. We should write the code using the generic set-property call (utils.cpp has setProperty() function). If PIM requires something special, we\u0027ll need to work that in later but I think the non-persistent PIM set-property should be fine, as we\u0027ll re-run all this on BMC reboots.",
